<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/31/eng@/~cl_4__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after subsection ( 1 ) the following subsections: \"(2) Sections 74A and 74B shall, so far as applicable, have effect in relation to instruments referred to in paragraph 85(2)(b) as they have effect in relation to cheques. (3) Section 74A shall, so far as applicable, have effect in relation to instruments referred to in paragraph 85(2)(c) as they have effect in relation to cheques.\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/31/eng@> .
